From: grubbychicken <ben@grbychkn.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 10:37:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ML4 W3/W4: dtr format 1 (K3 mul1, no E4M3) and the F16W GEMV
 codec, G6_MODEL_ML4 only; dtr_ml4_test + dtr_ml4_ref.py

